                    coach_r1_underfunded:   `<strong>“Just double the budget” is the trap.</strong> A bigger foundation buys more scholarships and warmer press — and still leaves you 22% short on coffee with no audited inclusive-sourcing evidence. Money isn’t the missing ingredient; <em>connection to the business model</em> is. Where would a peso of philanthropy create competitive advantage?`,
