                    coach_r2_scalecsr:      `<strong>You doubled the foundation — and changed nothing about the business.</strong> The press is warm, but your coffee is still 22% short, the competitor is still signing your farmers, and your ESG customer still has no audited evidence. Herrera’s question stands: <em>where is the competitive advantage?</em> This is philanthropy, not strategy.`,
